    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to Flow Of Fortune!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1. Learning Through Practice</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468900/extras/90bc1fb03b6d699cc15ec8160b6b2815.poster.avif?t=1754469248\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468900/extras/90bc1fb03b6d699cc15ec8160b6b2815.webm?t=1754469248\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468900/extras/90bc1fb03b6d699cc15ec8160b6b2815.mp4?t=1754469248\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A safe playground to hone financial skills and test risky moves without losing real money.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2. A Unique Blend of Role-Playing and Economic Strategies</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468900/extras/c39038bf519aa4be721faf139fdd15b2.poster.avif?t=1754469248\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468900/extras/c39038bf519aa4be721faf139fdd15b2.webm?t=1754469248\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468900/extras/c39038bf519aa4be721faf139fdd15b2.mp4?t=1754469248\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Your character grows like in an RPG, yet you manage assets and businesses reminiscent of a classic board game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3. Solo or Multiplayer Gameplay</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468900/extras/aefb820c7db06130fc3e74878d4d90e5.poster.avif?t=1754469248\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468900/extras/aefb820c7db06130fc3e74878d4d90e5.webm?t=1754469248\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468900/extras/aefb820c7db06130fc3e74878d4d90e5.mp4?t=1754469248\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Compete with friends online or go solo, experimenting with various tactics and starting conditions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4. No Violence</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468900/extras/191fe840e0213b2508bbde7fe581ac6b.poster.avif?t=1754469248\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468900/extras/191fe840e0213b2508bbde7fe581ac6b.webm?t=1754469248\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468900/extras/191fe840e0213b2508bbde7fe581ac6b.mp4?t=1754469248\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>You don\u2019t solve problems through conflict. It\u2019s all about sensible financial policy, negotiation skills, and resource allocation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>5. Excitement Without Fear</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468900/extras/9d0505d08b62bf28bca4dabcbfb752ed.poster.avif?t=1754469248\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468900/extras/9d0505d08b62bf28bca4dabcbfb752ed.webm?t=1754469248\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468900/extras/9d0505d08b62bf28bca4dabcbfb752ed.mp4?t=1754469248\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Virtual dice rolls add dynamism and unpredictability; mistakes don\u2019t cost you anything in real life\u2014only valuable lessons.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Why This Game Is For You</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overcome Your Fear of Investments and Mistakes</strong><br>Most people hesitate to invest or run a business, worried about making a fatal error. <i>Flow to Fortune</i> lets you try out any financial strategy without real-world losses, helping you realize that errors are simply part of the journey to success.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Understand How the \u201cWealthy\u201d Think and Use Their Time</strong><br>In this game, you\u2019ll see the difference between those who live paycheck to paycheck and those who invest in assets generating consistent income. Discover why effective time management and careful planning give you a crucial edge toward financial stability.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Learn from Real-Life Scenarios</strong><br>Though <i>Flow to Fortune</i> has the feel of a board game, it mirrors many real-world situations. You can practice running a business, weathering market downturns, facing unexpected expenses, and deciding whether bigger risks might lead to even greater rewards.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Mechanics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1. Digital Board Setup</strong><br>Roll virtual dice, move along the board, and encounter diverse events\u2014ranging from lucrative deals and training courses to unexpected expenses and crises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2. Time Management</strong><br>Allocate monthly hours among work, skill upgrades, business activities, and leisure. Any neglected area can drag you down eventually.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3. Business and Investments</strong><br>Start with a small venture or jump straight into stocks, real estate, or new projects. Be prepared, though, for market instability and risks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4. Skill Development</strong><br>Level up your character\u2019s technical, social, or other abilities\u2014each providing bonuses for managing assets or reducing the hours you need to spend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>5. No Violence or Aggression</strong><br>This game focuses on logical thinking and personal growth over conflict or combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Flow to Fortune</i> delivers an engaging, educational experience that helps you see your mistakes not as failures, but as opportunities to learn. Dive into the world of clever budgeting, time allocation, and strategic growth\u2014without fear of real-world losses or aggression.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to Flow Of Fortune!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1. Learning Through Practice</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468900/extras/90bc1fb03b6d699cc15ec8160b6b2815.poster.avif?t=1754469248\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468900/extras/90bc1fb03b6d699cc15ec8160b6b2815.webm?t=1754469248\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468900/extras/90bc1fb03b6d699cc15ec8160b6b2815.mp4?t=1754469248\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A safe playground to hone financial skills and test risky moves without losing real money.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2. A Unique Blend of Role-Playing and Economic Strategies</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468900/extras/c39038bf519aa4be721faf139fdd15b2.poster.avif?t=1754469248\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468900/extras/c39038bf519aa4be721faf139fdd15b2.webm?t=1754469248\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468900/extras/c39038bf519aa4be721faf139fdd15b2.mp4?t=1754469248\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Your character grows like in an RPG, yet you manage assets and businesses reminiscent of a classic board game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3. Solo or Multiplayer Gameplay</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468900/extras/aefb820c7db06130fc3e74878d4d90e5.poster.avif?t=1754469248\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468900/extras/aefb820c7db06130fc3e74878d4d90e5.webm?t=1754469248\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468900/extras/aefb820c7db06130fc3e74878d4d90e5.mp4?t=1754469248\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Compete with friends online or go solo, experimenting with various tactics and starting conditions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4. No Violence</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468900/extras/191fe840e0213b2508bbde7fe581ac6b.poster.avif?t=1754469248\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468900/extras/191fe840e0213b2508bbde7fe581ac6b.webm?t=1754469248\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468900/extras/191fe840e0213b2508bbde7fe581ac6b.mp4?t=1754469248\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>You don\u2019t solve problems through conflict. It\u2019s all about sensible financial policy, negotiation skills, and resource allocation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>5. Excitement Without Fear</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468900/extras/9d0505d08b62bf28bca4dabcbfb752ed.poster.avif?t=1754469248\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468900/extras/9d0505d08b62bf28bca4dabcbfb752ed.webm?t=1754469248\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468900/extras/9d0505d08b62bf28bca4dabcbfb752ed.mp4?t=1754469248\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Virtual dice rolls add dynamism and unpredictability; mistakes don\u2019t cost you anything in real life\u2014only valuable lessons.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Why This Game Is For You</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overcome Your Fear of Investments and Mistakes</strong><br>Most people hesitate to invest or run a business, worried about making a fatal error. <i>Flow to Fortune</i> lets you try out any financial strategy without real-world losses, helping you realize that errors are simply part of the journey to success.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Understand How the \u201cWealthy\u201d Think and Use Their Time</strong><br>In this game, you\u2019ll see the difference between those who live paycheck to paycheck and those who invest in assets generating consistent income. Discover why effective time management and careful planning give you a crucial edge toward financial stability.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Learn from Real-Life Scenarios</strong><br>Though <i>Flow to Fortune</i> has the feel of a board game, it mirrors many real-world situations. You can practice running a business, weathering market downturns, facing unexpected expenses, and deciding whether bigger risks might lead to even greater rewards.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Mechanics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1. Digital Board Setup</strong><br>Roll virtual dice, move along the board, and encounter diverse events\u2014ranging from lucrative deals and training courses to unexpected expenses and crises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2. Time Management</strong><br>Allocate monthly hours among work, skill upgrades, business activities, and leisure. Any neglected area can drag you down eventually.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3. Business and Investments</strong><br>Start with a small venture or jump straight into stocks, real estate, or new projects. Be prepared, though, for market instability and risks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4. Skill Development</strong><br>Level up your character\u2019s technical, social, or other abilities\u2014each providing bonuses for managing assets or reducing the hours you need to spend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>5. No Violence or Aggression</strong><br>This game focuses on logical thinking and personal growth over conflict or combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Flow to Fortune</i> delivers an engaging, educational experience that helps you see your mistakes not as failures, but as opportunities to learn. Dive into the world of clever budgeting, time allocation, and strategic growth\u2014without fear of real-world losses or aggression.</p>",
